│ Reasoning:                                                         │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue is that the current implementation incorrectly handles   │
│ two-digit years in parse_http_date. It assumes that years 0-69 are │
│ in the 2000s and 70-99 are in the 1900s, which is not aligned with │
│ RFC 7231's requirement that a timestamp with a two-digit year      │
│ should be interpreted as the most recent year in the past with the │
│ same last two digits if it appears to be more than 50 years in the │
│ future. The code needs to compare the year against the current     │
│ year to determine the correct century.                             │
│                                                                    │
│ Patch:                                                             │
│                                                                    │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
│ ┃                         modification 1                         ┃ │
│ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ │
│                                                                    │
│                                                                    │
│  [file]django/utils/http.py[/file]                                 │
│  [original]179             if year < 100:                          │
│  180                 if year < 70:                                 │
│  181                     year += 2000                              │
│  182                 else:                                         │
│  183                     year += 1900                              │
│  [/original]                                                       │
│  [patched]179             if year < 100:                           │
│  180                 if year < current_year - 50:                  │
│  181                     year += 2000                              │
│  182                 else:                                         │
│  183                     year += 1900                              │
│  [/patched]                                                        │
│                                                                    │
